# Mars Mission Plan

## Mission Goals

The main goal of the mission is to explore Mars and collect scientific information about the planet.
The mission could study the Martian surface, atmosphere, and environment to help NASA understand Mars and prepare for future human exploration.

## Mission Stages

The mission would begin with planning and preparation on Earth.
After launch, the spacecraft would travel toward Mars before entering the planet's orbit or landing on its surface.
The mission would then collect scientific data and send the information back to Earth.
